
  TMUX CHEATSHEET                                    prefix: Ctrl-a
 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  SESSIONS
  ────────
  tmux                     Start new session
  tmux new -s name         Start named session
  tmux attach              Attach to last session
  tmux attach -t name      Attach to named session
  tmux ls                  List sessions
  prefix d                 Detach (session keeps running)
  prefix $                 Rename session
  prefix S                 fzf session picker (sesh)
  prefix F                 sesh popup picker

  WINDOWS
  ───────
  prefix c                 New window (current path)
  prefix ,                 Rename window
  prefix 1-9               Switch to window by number
  prefix n / p             Next / previous window
  prefix &                 Kill window

  PANES
  ─────
  prefix |                 Split horizontal (current path)
  prefix -                 Split vertical (current path)
  prefix h/j/k/l           Navigate panes (vim-style)
  C-h/j/k/l                Navigate panes — passes through to vim splits
  prefix H/J/K/L           Resize pane (repeatable, 5 cols/rows)
  prefix Tab               Cycle pane layouts
  prefix z                 Zoom / unzoom pane
  prefix !                 Break pane into new window
  prefix @                 Join pane from another window (fzf picker)
  prefix x                 Kill pane

  COPY MODE  (vi-style)
  ─────────────────────
  prefix Enter             Enter copy mode
  v                        Begin selection
  Ctrl-v                   Toggle rectangle selection
  y                        Copy selection and exit
  q                        Exit copy mode

  PLUGINS
  ───────
  prefix I                 Install plugins (TPM)
  prefix U                 Update plugins

  MISC
  ────
  prefix r                 Reload config
  prefix ?                 Show this cheatsheet
  Mouse                    Enabled — click panes/windows, scroll history

